  "description": "This SOP is for the routine maintenance and expansion of adherent cancer cell lines. \nIt also details how cells are harvested and counted for use in downstream protocols.\nThis protocol is also used in expasion of Cas9 transduced cell lines, prior to banking.\n\nProcess diagram:\n[image.png]](https://content.protocols.io/public/b94e6458af3e4aa17dc6c162a5d28b87f529d83e9d05c0764f6eb3fffa72f21d/ccgfbdsax.png)\n \n",
