  "ethics_statement": "",
  "fork_id": null,
  "funders": [],
  "guid": "B0A89EA09DBA11EA814529A47F98D72C",
  "guidelines": "1. Cancer cells should be passaged at ~80-90% confluent where possible. They should not be allowed to reach 100% confluence.\n\n\n[image.png]](https://content.protocols.io/public/b94e6458af3e4aa17dc6c162a5d28b87f529d83e9d05c0764f6eb3fffa72f21d/b9tybdsax.png)\nFigure 1. Adherent cancer cell line ready to be passaged (x5). \n",
